Q: Fixing Form Input Visibility and Contrast Issues Between Light and Dark Mode on Mobile Devices A: <pre><code>@media (max-width:768px){

/* ---------- LIGHT MODE ---------- */
body:not(.lecf-dark) .lecf-field input,
body:not(.lecf-dark) .lecf-field select,
body:not(.lecf-dark) .lecf-field textarea{

    background:#f8fafc;
    border:1.5px solid #bfc9d7;
    color:#1e293b;
    box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,.03);
}

body:not(.lecf-dark) .lecf-field input::placeholder,
body:not(.lecf-dark) .lecf-field textarea::placeholder{
    color:#94a3b8;
    opacity:1;
}

body:not(.lecf-dark) .lecf-field label{
    color:#334155;
}


/* ---------- DARK MODE ---------- */
.lecf-dark .lecf-field input,
.lecf-dark .lecf-field select,
.lecf-dark .lecf-field textarea{

    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
    color:#fff;
    box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,.02);
}

.lecf-dark .lecf-field input::placeholder,
.lecf-dark .lecf-field textarea::placeholder{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);
    opacity:1;
}

.lecf-dark .lecf-field label{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
}

}
</code></pre>
